{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19181","headline":"客有话汴州新政书事寄令狐相公 · 刘禹锡","name":"客有话汴州新政书事寄令狐相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天下咽喉今大宁，军城喜气彻青冥。\n庭前劒戟朝迎日，笔底文章夜应星。\n三省壁中题姓字，万人头上见仪形。\n汴州忽复承平事，正月看灯户不扃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}